%N A402026 Decimal expansion of L'(1,chi_{-23})/L(1,chi_{-23}) negated, where chi_{-23} is the Dirichlet character kronecker(-23,.).
%F A402026 Equals A402011 - (1/3) * Sum_{a=1..22} Legendre(a,23)*log Gamma(a/23).
%e A402026 L'(1,chi_{-23})/L(1,chi_{-23}) = -0.42212094803844732551...
%o A402026 (PARI) f(D) = my(L=lfuncreate(D)); lfun(L,1,1)/lfun(L,1,0); \\ D is a fundamental discriminant
%o A402026 f(-23)
%o A402026 (PARI) f(D) = my(h = qfbclassno(D)); log(2*Pi) + Euler() - (1/h) * sum(a=1, abs(D), kronecker(D,a)*lngamma(a/abs(D))); \\ D < -4 is a fundamental discriminant
%o A402026 f(-23)
%Y A402026 Cf. A011586 (chi_{-23}). See A402011 for related sequences.
